b&gt;P2 Internal to internal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: S3 bucket 1 &gt; Boomi MFT Local Node &gt; S3 bucket 2&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b3401a&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;P3 External to internal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: Pega LZ 1 &gt; Boomi MFT Cloud &gt; Local Node &gt; AV scan &gt; S3 bucket 1&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1e6b3a&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;P4 Internal to external&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: S3 bucket 2 &gt; Local Node &gt; Boomi MFT Cloud &gt; Pega LZ 2&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#52606d&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;Solid badge: the pattern uses this link. Dashed badge: only if D-MVP-01 or D-MVP-05 routes it there.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fb;strokeColor=#d9dee4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="620" width="960" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>